    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "S: Rhythm dive requires 20% available stamina, two rhythm stacks and no Exhausted status. A queues Find swimming rhythm; resolve buffs first, then try the dive. It spends one stack, so a second queued dive can become unavailable before payment. Hover disabled actions for exact requirements and current values. E recovers; B resolves. Return to standard controls for the other techniques.",
